OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FShowers
OL,6,Feasing tonight as cloud breaks,
OL,7,Fbringing some clearer spells in
OL,8,Fplaces. Winds turning very light which
OL,9,Fmay lead to isolated mist and fog
OL,10,Fpatches forming in prone rural spots.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FEarly mist and fog slowly
OL,13,Flift into patchy cloud initially
OL,14,Fbefore breaking up during the morning
OL,15,Fallowing some brighter spells to
OL,16,Fdevelop. Light winds and feeling mild
OL,17,Fin the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
